.TH QUIPU-AUDIT-QUARANTINE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-audit\-quarantine \- List refused\-attempt evidence behind verdicts
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu audit quarantine\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-verdict\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List refused\-attempt evidence behind verdicts
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-verdict\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Verdict identifier to inspect
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-audit\-quarantine\-list(1)
List refused\-attempt evidence, optionally for one verdict
.TP
quipu\-audit\-quarantine\-purge(1)
Purge quarantined evidence by graph, age or all
.TP
quipu\-audit\-quarantine\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
